---
title: Checkout flow
---
flowchart TD
  %% A customer checks out; payment can fail and be retried.
  start([Customer opens cart]) --> review[Review items]
  review --> signedIn{Signed in?}
  signedIn -->|No| login[Sign in or continue as guest]
  login --> address
  signedIn -->|Yes| address[Enter delivery address]
  address --> pay[Pay]

  subgraph payments [Payment service]
    pay --> charge{Card approved?}
    charge -- declined --> retry[Ask for another card]
    retry --> pay
  end

  charge -->|approved| confirm[Create order]
  confirm --> email[Send confirmation email]
  confirm -.-> analytics[(Analytics)]
  email --> done([Order placed])
